'''Master-Apprentice''' (師範といっしょ, ''Shihan to Issho'', '''With the Master''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Freeze" Effect UP (Sm): Freeze duration is increased by 10%.

